because I'm about to rewrite history
by cutting short the Ice Age.

247
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,322
So prepare to lose your mammoth.

248
00:14:58,460 --> 00:14:59,840
His time is up.

249
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:04,322
You should know better than anyone
that the past can't be changed.

250
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:07,140
My tusk mammoth will destroy your dragon.

251
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:11,980
Is it me, or is Noah going to attack
a monster that's stronger than his?

252
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:14,380
You're in for quite a surprise now.

253
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,100
You'll never defeat me.

254
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,717
I'm in control here.

255
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,940
Mokuba understands that now.

256
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:21,060
Why can't you?

257
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:24,780
This is my world, and
you're my prisoner. Forever!

258
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,800
Go ahead and attack me.

259
00:15:28,020 --> 00:15:30,520
My monster's stronger. Hey, wait!

260
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:33,197
Thanks to the special ability
of Noah's Tusk Mammoth,

261
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:36,515
both players will lose life
points when it's destroyed.

262
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:41,200
So when Kaiba Klaib is that ding,
it's like he's attacking himself, too.

263
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:43,240
We've got to stop him!

264
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:44,620
Mammoth, attack!

265
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:47,077
Activate Trap Guard.

266
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:48,500
Ring of Destruction!

267
00:15:49,860 --> 00:15:52,680
This will stop your monster in its tracks!

268
00:15:55,160 --> 00:15:57,984
Hmph, I see that you're
getting desperate, Seto.

269
00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:01,697
It's true your Ring of Destruction
will destroy my Tusk Mammoth,

270
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:04,380
but I'm afraid you'll
lose life points, too.

271
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:07,620
Not when I activate my
magic card, Ring of Defense!

272
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,880
It will shield my life points!

273
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:17,080
All right, nice move, Kaiba.

274
00:16:17,420 --> 00:16:19,832
Way to put that little runt in his place.

275
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:22,100
Looks like your ice age is over.

276
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:24,931
I guess you don't control everything here.

277
00:16:25,340 --> 00:16:28,677
Hey, you, they're both down to
their last chunk of life points.

278
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:32,020
Yeah, let's just hope Kaiba
can wipe out Noah's first.

279
00:16:32,900 --> 00:16:36,680
All right, now it's
time to finish you off.

280
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,057
I'm shaking in my boots.

281
00:16:39,140 --> 00:16:40,320
You should be.

282
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:43,973
First, I'll switch my dragon
from defense to attack mode.

283
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:47,840
Next, I'll send my Thunder
Dragon to the car graveyard,

284
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:50,860
where he'll be absorbed by Shinato's arc.

285
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:56,020
But not before his special skill
kicks in, giving me two more dragons.

286
00:16:56,400 --> 00:16:57,900
But that's not all, Noah.

287
00:16:58,460 --> 00:17:02,220
Next, I'll use Polymerization
to fuse them both together,

288
00:17:02,460 --> 00:17:05,620
forming Twin-Headed Thunder Dragon.

289
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:11,728
I'd hate to meet that
thing in a dark alley.

290
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:15,684
And thanks to my Quick Attack
Magic card, I can attack right now.

291
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:20,253
And with no monsters to protect you,
your life points are as good as gone.

292
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:24,500
You seem to have forgotten about
the powers of my arc, Seto.

293
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:29,044
Every monster that has been sent
to the graveyard lives on board,

294
00:17:29,140 --> 00:17:32,100
and I have access to all of them. Observe!

295
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:36,760
I thought Kaiba had him
that time. I guess not.

296
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,420
You fool!

297
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:43,600
You fell right into my trap!

298
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:48,429
Now, I can wipe out what's left of your
life points and end this family feud!

299
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:51,300
I didn't forget your
Deck Master's ability!

300
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:54,380
I wanted you to summon those monsters!

301
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,880
For one reason!

302
00:17:56,340 --> 00:17:57,660
So I could play this!

303
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:02,517
It's called Dragon's Rage,
and here's how it works!

304
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:07,360
If my monster's attack points are higher
than your monster's defense points,

305
00:18:07,580 --> 00:18:10,577
the difference comes directly
out of your life points.

306
00:18:10,660 --> 00:18:15,420
Prepare yourself as Different Dimension
Dragon attacks your giant Rex.

307
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:23,500
One monster down and one more to go.

308
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:27,480
Yeah, nice.

309
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:30,660
Now beat that last monster and it's over.

310
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:34,100
This is where it all ends. Uh-huh.

311
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:38,200
Now, twin-headed Thunder Dragon,
attack his giant soldier!

312
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:39,480
Don't do it!

313
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,800
What's going on? Mokuba!

314
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:44,042
What have you done to him, Noah?

315
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:46,110
Mokuba!

316
00:18:46,193 --> 00:18:47,360
Whoever you are,

317
00:18:47,620 --> 00:18:51,620
if you want to attack my brother
Noah, you'll have to go through me.

318
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:52,830
Mokuba!

319
00:18:52,913 --> 00:18:54,000
Snap out of it!

320
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:56,320
He's been brainwashed by Noah!

321
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:00,990
Ha-ha!

322
00:19:01,073 --> 00:19:03,420
That's right, Mokuba!
Protect me! From him!

323
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:07,013
He's the stranger that's trying
to break you and I apart!

324
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:08,790
Stranger...

325
00:19:08,873 --> 00:19:09,703
No, it's me!

326
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:13,940
Mokuba has chosen sides based
upon his own free will, Seto.

327
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:17,637
Looking back, maybe you should
have treated him with more respect.

328
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:20,014
I give him the support you never could.

329
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:25,260
It didn't have to be this way, Seto.

330
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:27,580
But you left me with no choice.

331
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:29,862
Now you have a decision to make.

332
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:33,840
Forfeit this duel and step down
as president of Kaiba Corp.

333
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:38,580
Or continue with your final attack
and risk losing Mokuba for good.

334
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:41,040
Your brother's fate is in your hands.

335
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:44,800
If Kaiba attacks Noah now,
he'll be attacking Mokuba also.

336
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:47,137
So, what's it gonna be?

337
00:19:47,220 --> 00:19:50,880
Mokuba or control of Kaiba Corp. Decide!

338
00:19:51,180 --> 00:19:54,420
Your choice will impact
the rest of your life!
